Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,During this start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.97,0:00:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-X-O!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,zar 돼!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.09,0:01:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You must escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.35,0:01:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this virtual world's\Nabout to go bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And when it's destroyed, it's\Ntaking our minds with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.73,0:01:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.95,0:01:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.19,0:01:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The only exit is in the\NDomino Arcade. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.69,0:01:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we trust him? Well, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.55,0:01:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about it. We...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No choice, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.81,0:01:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We have nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.55,0:01:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, but I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not pull any of\Nyour dirty tricks, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, your plan to digitize the\Nentire planet has been squashed. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.19,0:01:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you betray me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.77,0:01:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And after everything\Nthat I've done for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.69,0:01:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You used me and everyone around\Nyou for your own selfish goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:01:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.25,0:02:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your own satellite will destroy the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,central computer that\Nruns your virtual world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.11,0:02:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.81,0:02:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you call off the satellite attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you and I\Nrule this cyber universe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.27,0:02:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,together once I trap\Nthe entire world here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.93,0:02:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.29,0:02:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.47,0:02:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like you've failed again,\Nso I guess there's one thing left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I guess there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.63,0:02:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Escape from this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I don't have a body\Nof my own, I'll take yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a corrupt\Ncomputer file infecting this system!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.85,0:02:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to prove your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.07,0:02:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,then get back in your corner and duel me,\Nand the winner gets to escape in my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.05,0:02:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's continue,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and then we'll find out who deserves\Nto be president of Kaiba Corp,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and who deserves to be deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:03:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept your foolish challenge, and I'll\Nmake sure it's your mind that gets erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move now. Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.99,0:03:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia Necros, attack Shadow's\NForce Raider right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but I play the\Ntrap card negate attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It stops your monster in its tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gozaburo said his Exodia Necros\Ncouldn't be destroyed by trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can still stop\Nits attacks with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, all you're doing is just\Ndelaying your eventual defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My Exodia Necros is unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So just admit that I've\Noutsmarted you this time, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sadly mistaken as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Exodia is far from unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've already figured\Nout a way to defeat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.49,0:03:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do it, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Domino Arcade is only two blocks away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And the exit should be inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.41,0:04:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'll\Noutrun Gozoboro's monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, then you guys go\Nand we'll stay and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not gonna go without\Nyou, Joey. Just go, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.43,0:04:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, help my sister find that exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.95,0:04:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.11,0:04:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet you over there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.19,0:04:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't take too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll smash him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're better off with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were we? Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.49,0:04:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the magic card shrink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm able to reduce the attack\Npoints of your monster by half.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.31,0:04:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So your Exodia Nekros is now weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I'll sacrifice my Force\NRaider to summon Luster Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Luster Dragon,\Nattack his Exodia Nekros.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:04:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.75,0:05:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,so even though your monster\Nseems to be invincible,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,it does have a weakness after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.71,0:05:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What weakness? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.97,0:05:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though Exodia Nekros\Ncan't be sent to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,if I attack it with a more powerful\Nmonster, you still lose life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So get to the point, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be true that Exodia\NNekros is invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.87,0:05:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,However, that doesn't mean you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.59,0:05:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My Exodia Nekros gains 1,000 points with\Nevery battle, bringing it up to 3,800!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.51,0:05:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his dragon with your mighty fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, prepare to sink into virtual\Ndarkness while my strength grows!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.05,0:05:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.87,0:05:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But the exit could be anywhere in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:05:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You must proceed to the stage in the\Nback of the arcade in order to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.37,0:06:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand on the red and blue platforms and\NI'll upload you back to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now uploading brainwaves from virtual\Nenvironment to simulation pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We really have been here all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.79,0:06:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we all made it\Nback without any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, speak for yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.43,0:06:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.87,0:06:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look like a\Nrobot monkey anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.81,0:06:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, he doesn't look\Nthat different to me. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.85,0:06:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.59,0:06:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The others are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems everyone's made it to the arcade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:06:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.09,0:07:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.51,0:07:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceed to the stage immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you and Duke go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.89,0:07:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But you better be right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Magician, attack! Come on! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.35,0:07:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.29,0:07:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Upload successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's great to be back\Nin the real world, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you everything would be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're Noah, then where's Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There, inside the virtual\Nworld with Yugi and Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I needed Yugi to stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he stayed back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.13,0:08:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Kaiba didn't have enough\Nbrains to find the exit on his own?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto is trapped in a duel with Gozaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.23,0:08:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use the central computer to create\Na virtual shortcut so you can reach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.85,0:08:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in Kaiba Corp headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go through that door and you'll find Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't come back without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to rescue Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.27,0:08:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, you hated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wrong, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have treated\Nyou guys the way that I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I was jealous and angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.29,0:08:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, for everything I said about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I deserved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Four minutes to satellite attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.93,0:08:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone should return\Nto the blimp immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.39,0:08:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe here now. Noah's\Nright. Come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:09:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, you're the only one who can get\Nthose three guys out of there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.23,0:09:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the magic card, Pot of Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.59,0:09:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows me to draw two more cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.37,0:09:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll play a monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, I'll place this face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be so confident when it's\Nobvious that I have the advantage set off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.59,0:09:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodian Necros has\N4,800 attack points now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never summon a\Nmore powerful monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.81,0:09:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a lot to learn about\Nthe game of Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And the first rule of\Nthe game is never rely
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,on the power of a single\Nmonster to win a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.59,0:09:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to lose your body, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:10:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his face down, monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've each gained\N1,000 more attack points!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.53,0:10:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no monsters left\Nto protect you, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,One more attack and freedom is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning, two minutes to satellite attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.35,0:10:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you and Seto don't get through that\Nexit soon, your mind will be lost forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll play Monster\NReborn to bring my ancient
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.73,0:10:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,lamp back from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, watch and learn, Gozoboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I use my lamp's special ability
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,to summon La Jin, the\Nmystical genie of the lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I haven't been\Nable to destroy your Exodia Necros.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.29,0:10:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been attacking its body when\NI should have been attacking its
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.31,0:11:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul, so now I activate the trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,card soul demolition no you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,do this I'm afraid I can I know\Nthat the soul of your monster
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.87,0:11:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,lies in your card graveyard and\Nmy trap card allows each player to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,destroy every monster in their\Nopponent's graveyard for the small
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Price of 500 life points each. As\Nyou can see, my graveyard doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,contain much however look at yours\Nit contains the five cards that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,give your monster power the five\Npieces of exodia the forbidden one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.19,0:11:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,no this can't be first\Ni'll destroy exodia's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,left leg which protected\Nit from magic cards and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,next i'll destroy the right leg of exodia
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.19,0:11:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Followed by Exodia's left\Narm, then I'll destroy the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.93,0:11:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,right arm so your exodia\Nnecros loses the 4 000
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,attack points it gained\Nnow the last piece goes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:12:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,ahead of exodia the forbidden one now your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.23,0:12:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,creature drops to its\Noriginal 1800 attack points
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.51,0:12:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,too bad and it's no longer\Nprotected from my monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,so i sacrifice both of my\Ncreatures to summon this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My Blue-Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.69,0:12:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid that's checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Blue-Eyes, attack his Exodia Necros!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.77,0:12:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose, stepfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.95,0:12:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,One minute to satellite attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.09,0:12:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.91,0:12:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two better escape soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.89,0:13:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I lose this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when you challenge\Nsomeone who's superior to you in every way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you who's superior\Nby taking over your body, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.35,0:13:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what about our agreement?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.39,0:13:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is gonna shut down any second!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.23,0:13:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Satellite attack in three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Targeting central computer network.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Commencing launch sequence now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.97,0:13:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Head to the Domino Arcade immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.05,0:14:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dead end!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.77,0:14:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to trust him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.39,0:14:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.49,0:14:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah opened another exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Satellite attack approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back in the real world!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.43,0:14:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping me, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to know my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.45,0:14:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So, does this mean you're not coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must return to cyberspace first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's shutting down, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then come with me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.33,0:15:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's something\NI still have to do, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You believed in me and you\Ntreated me like a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn to return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.59,0:15:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.67,0:15:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.63,0:15:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, wake up! Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto! Noah's still inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make a mistake even without a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can upload my mind to another network.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.93,0:15:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.55,0:15:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.15,0:15:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sealed off all the exits,\Nso there's no way you can escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.91,0:15:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's all over for you. Alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Central computer network will destruct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.63,0:15:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate the base immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Noah have to go\Nback to that place, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, it's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.03,0:16:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go before that computer\Nblows, and time is running out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.57,0:16:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.05,0:16:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning, missile approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot be stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think you have\Nthe power to keep me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can control this place as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You choose them over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,At least they believed in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're family, and don't ever forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.19,0:16:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't let you hurt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.57,0:16:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm keeping you trapped in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.93,0:16:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you to release\Nme immediately, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to free your mind and make\Nsure you never harm anyone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:16:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Khybercraft 3, preparing for\Ntakeoff. Hold on. Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.55,0:17:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Engaging rear thruster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up the pace, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.43,0:17:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We got you. Let's go. Grab on. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.37,0:17:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.00,0:17:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtual meltdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.07,0:17:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.25,0:17:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, I'm afraid this ship is\Ntoo slow to escape the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.71,0:18:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking control.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.85,0:18:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never escape me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, old man, but there's\Nno way I'll let you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah may have been a spoiled\Nbrat when we met him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but he turned out to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.11,0:18:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think his mind was deleted\Nwhen the computer was destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing him, he saved his\Nmind on a backup file.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.01,0:18:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet he'll be back. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.17,0:18:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,See you around, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.51,0:19:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.65,0:19:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That little detour was a complete\Nwaste of my time and effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's move on and pretend\Nthat nonsense never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.89,0:19:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to continue\Nthe Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.07,0:19:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Set us back on course to\NKaivakorp Island. Yes, sir.
